          "en": "The Supreme People's Court\nReply on the Question Whether, in the Trial of a Unit Crime Case, the Person Directly\nin Charge and Other Persons Directly Responsible Should Be Distinguished as\nPrincipal Offender and Accessory\nFa Shi No. 31 [2000]\n(Adopted at the 1,132nd meeting of the Judicial Committee of the Supreme People's Court on 28 September 2000; promulgated by announcement of the Supreme People's Court on 30 September 2000; coming into force on 10 October 2000)\nThe Higher People's Court of Hubei Province:\nE Gao Fa No. 374 [1999], the \"Request for Instructions on the Question Whether the 'Person Directly in Charge' and 'Other Persons Directly Responsible' Should Be Divided into Principal Offender and Accessory in a Case of the Crime of Letter of Credit Fraud Committed by a Unit\", submitted by your court has been received. After study, the reply is as follows:\nIn the trial of a case of intentional crime committed by a unit, the person directly in charge and other persons directly responsible may not be distinguished as principal offender or accessory, and shall be sentenced in accordance with the role they played in the unit crime.\nThis is our reply."
